{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:01:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_f58d8eef1ae04d8b9b8bb91c9ed483f1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1ed1e451ac0798b98b6ec6988e60c30f7fe95b1295ba005cb4d95d63a9a993da","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"fuxicodex/fuxi@ab2785904754 snapshot 2d08cae774751f9b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9466238fdafadcba3fcbe6cb546f18de75e338517e311f0aa697759350a5abf7"],"source_ids":["src_887f5d32422a594782426ff7e3450d9f"],"text":"FuXi is documented as a terminal AI coding agent built in Go, shipped as a single static binary with no runtime dependencies, positioned as a provider-agnostic alternative to Claude Code.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:01:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f58d8eef1ae04d8b9b8bb91c9ed483f1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:01:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_f58d8eef1ae04d8b9b8bb91c9ed483f1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5bb1f3847f4984638c76a18d3c27a8df1cddf1c5ee443a5c338165a44b9d0a38","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"fuxicodex/fuxi@ab2785904754 snapshot 2d08cae774751f9b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_73372a7bad9c15ee3b10300e6e60abf15b5c540d4f1e03ab7f311814c16fc9b6","slc_9e3df1480047dd377dbbf5149031e3b14c639d99781037e885a2bd4c6f11d1c4"],"source_ids":["src_887f5d32422a594782426ff7e3450d9f"],"text":"The README reports a self-run head-to-head benchmark against another coding agent using an objective pytest+coverage scorer across 15 micro and 4 large-project dimensions, and explicitly cautions it is a small, non-third-party task set measuring the agent loop.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:01:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f58d8eef1ae04d8b9b8bb91c9ed483f1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:01:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_f58d8eef1ae04d8b9b8bb91c9ed483f1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_639ee5fabe7c55abd2aa268bd6483507d749312f36ab51860a108e802933efe4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"fuxicodex/fuxi@ab2785904754 snapshot 2d08cae774751f9b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_20deb9ce8656ba28f0ae9cec2ff5f71ecb1cdda88d36a3233261371f24e46ee5","slc_9466238fdafadcba3fcbe6cb546f18de75e338517e311f0aa697759350a5abf7"],"source_ids":["src_2f8a8a655d6b5dcabc93da7deb2a0832","src_887f5d32422a594782426ff7e3450d9f"],"text":"The agent is described as running a Think → Act → Verify loop: it reasons about a task, acts with built-in tools, inspects results, and iterates until the work is verified.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:01:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f58d8eef1ae04d8b9b8bb91c9ed483f1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:01:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_f58d8eef1ae04d8b9b8bb91c9ed483f1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6920e1412e414365b7e7e3f04f6a409ff062ee2b2d8713a9ea02e329e5c722c7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"fuxicodex/fuxi@ab2785904754 snapshot 2d08cae774751f9b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_42ba305f264411739e427a19d169a6fb1f79826769a83619d9ed782ea3672727","slc_6edaf54069ee21cf89fa0700a88e79c933f176a42d075a39c0efa201cf9c672e"],"source_ids":["src_2f8a8a655d6b5dcabc93da7deb2a0832","src_887f5d32422a594782426ff7e3450d9f"],"text":"Sessions are described as durable: transcripts persist to disk, checkpoints allow resume, rollback, or fork, long conversations auto-compact, and an idle 'dreaming' pass consolidates memory across sessions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:01:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f58d8eef1ae04d8b9b8bb91c9ed483f1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:01:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_f58d8eef1ae04d8b9b8bb91c9ed483f1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_69f246579dd0af64583445181b87e87579175c693e7815b8d8477d26624cf843","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"fuxicodex/fuxi@ab2785904754 snapshot 2d08cae774751f9b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_641372100d2489f185b1838ce6724bb490f65797b6ee76f62fe267253ab004cb","slc_6edaf54069ee21cf89fa0700a88e79c933f176a42d075a39c0efa201cf9c672e","slc_bb6746b3a55287ce39cfbcd172cc7f654b162784229179f4b087e500e4e7abd2","slc_f2e09402b1c63f4a273ceda81fbcc79bcc548b04f2bbe50096badf5b3faa4151"],"source_ids":["src_2f8a8a655d6b5dcabc93da7deb2a0832","src_887f5d32422a594782426ff7e3450d9f"],"text":"Shell commands reportedly pass an AST safety classifier and rule set before execution, with fine-grained permissions and audit logging; permission modes are default, plan, and bypassPermissions, plus a classifier-gated --auto mode with a circuit breaker.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:01:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f58d8eef1ae04d8b9b8bb91c9ed483f1"}
